Package: plato
Version: 0.9.45-1
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Plato Team <plato@example.com>
Installed-Size: 18138
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.39), libgcc-s1 (>= 4.2), zlib1g (>= 1:1.1.4)
Section: text
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/baskerville/plato
Description: Document reader for Linux
 Plato is a document reader supporting PDF, EPUB, CBZ, and DJVU formats.
 This package provides the Linux version using the Linux framebuffer.
 It shares the same core functionality as the e-ink device version.
